   196→\subsection{Units}
   197→
   198→It is mandatory to state the measurement units.
   199→The \verb|siunitx| provides commands that implement some of the best ways to do it.
   200→For instance, you type \verb|\SI{10}{\mega\hertz}| and produce \SI{10}{\mega\hertz}.

